  <item>
    <title>No.61 西班牙｜出海观鲸、云海日落、城市漫步...没想到旅行的后劲这么大！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67399e07f373fe5d4de98783</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67399e07f373fe5d4de98783</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 17 Nov 2024 08:03:59 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>Hi，朋友们，好久不见，花花回归～</span></p><span></span><p><span>老实说这是我写得最困难的一期shownotes，内容量很大，想表达的东西很多很复杂，又怀揣着对这个地方的喜欢想安利给所有的人心情，所以迟迟码不出一个字，以至于从节目录完到剪辑完拖了一周又一周。</span></p><span></span><p><span>今天情绪好像到了，那就让我来好好讲讲。</span></p><span></span><p><span>看标题就知道这是一期旅行节目，邀请了我的好朋友瓜瓜来聊聊我们国庆的西班牙游。我们去的是巴塞罗那和特内里费这两个地方，前者是西班牙第二大城市，也是加泰罗尼亚自治区首府，后者是靠近非洲海岸大西洋中的加那利群岛7个岛屿中最大的一个岛屿。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们在这趟旅行中欣赏了美景，品尝了美食，买了纪念品，也丢过行李...每次打开音频剪辑，又仿佛回到了这段美好旅程，好想再去呀～</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵本期音乐推荐：《Sweet Wanomi》- Bill Withers</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎙【节目详情】：</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>出发前请准备：</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>签证</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="109">01:49</a> 现在已经免预约了，听说出签速度也变快了，冲吧！</span></p><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="510">08:30</a> 行程单简单规划合理即可，不需要与实际行程完全一致</span></p><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="627">10:27</a> 办签证阶段机票提供预付款截图，酒店选择可以免费取消的</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>机酒</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="827">13:47</a> 尽量早点买，各个平台多比价</span></p><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1086">18:06</a> 信息填错也别怕，及时更改确认</span></p><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1193">19:53</a> 国外廉航行李额闲鱼慎重</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>景点门票</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>西班牙很多景点最好提前买门票，不然没票去不了会很可惜！！</span></p><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1350">22:30</a> 官网、飞猪、去哪儿多多对比</span></p><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1504">25:04</a> 苹果钱包真好用，门票、机票都可存</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>租车&amp;国际驾照</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1629">27:09</a> 租车平台就可以做西班牙认证的翻译，当然别忘了带驾照原件</span></p><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1714">28:34</a> 记得买好保险</span></p><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1793">29:53</a> 带上一张没有银联标识的有芯片的外币信用卡</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>准备就绪，开始我们的行程：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>📍第一站特内里费🌋，有些地方一定要亲自去看看</span></p><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2076">34:36</a> 一个经验教训：自助托运一定要先贴再扫码！！</span></p><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2186">36:26</a> 另一个经验教训：没贴托运条箱子就被传送带送进去后，千万别信巴塞机场工作人员的箱子能到目的地的鬼话</span></p><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2317">38:37</a> 否则目的地机场的工作人员会告诉你：嘿，还真是没有</span></p><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2516">41:56</a> &nbsp;特内里费Dreams Jardin 你就住吧，好吃好拍，性价比高</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgYBR4JPl7trFGI7G2HREo8zj-w-.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2961">49:21</a> 出海观鲸推荐双体船，带一件薄外套，防晒又防风</span></p><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3125">52:05</a> 无法用语言形容的人生3h</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgwMYNSXXFlVsJXEVfbGMSIES2fY.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3307">55:07</a> 早上去看到鲸鱼的概率很大</span></p><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3376">56:16</a> 来都来了，怎么能不看云海日落</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqLr3UhnXO3diVyNuTSgYF7qHjoN.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3524">58:44</a> 可以选择TF38路线，记得提前下好地图</span></p><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3640">1:00:40</a> 仿佛来到了漫威大电影的场景，像火星也像沙漠</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhxlUJR-vrdG0B6KijrDNJ3iTYkc.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3731">1:02:11</a> 在异国他乡碰到中国同胞互说国庆快乐，好温暖啊</span></p><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3819">1:03:39</a> 天然泳池很美，张张美照的背后都是毛坯人生</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnQO5_iUjU_Nv6AQG7hrXzPWgiIc.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3913">1:05:13</a> 说真的，去欧洲海岛自驾可以提前学学环岛出口</span></p><span></span><p><span>📍接下来回到城里巴塞罗那，好吃好逛好买</span></p><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4202">1:10:02</a> 交通月卡真的好香</span></p><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4376">1:12:56</a> 打车直接路边拦就可以，很方便</span></p><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4435">1:13:55</a> 高迪几件套总归要看看吧：我知道圣家堂很厉害，但亲眼看到的时候还是有被震撼到；巴特罗之家好漂亮，高迪不愧是天才建筑师</span></p><span></span><p><span>插入照片</span></p><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4491">1:14:51</a> 冰箱贴买少了，怎么会这么漂亮</span></p><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4582">1:16:22</a> 巴特罗之家的帆布袋很适合当伴手礼</span></p><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4815">1:20:15</a> 焦糖山是被误传的名字</span></p><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4939">1:22:19</a> 坐缆车偶遇92年巴塞奥运会跳水台、一路顺到海边玻璃建筑、哥特区</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoitiZokeWqyAKzcy91QOgnrcEAY.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5222">1:27:02</a> 嗯，club体验一下</span></p><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5259">1:27:39</a> 巴塞罗那真好吃，甚至比上海便宜</span></p><span></span><p><span>Portonovo Silvestre：海鲜饭必吃！火腿、炸海鲜拼盘、小青椒每个都好吃</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrlV9qRg4xTc7tEs77gDBkTySlRV.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>Nomad：小红书狂推荐的咖啡，反正我们都没喝明白吧</span></p><span></span><p><span>Joncake巴斯克蛋糕：普通，不必排大长队，上海好吃的蛋糕很多</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Flcbwb6QheeOa0lP48OHy3Tw3zVG.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>Bon Mercat：好喝到让我养成喝咖啡的习惯，可颂、donuts、bocadilo都很好吃</span></p><span></span><p><span>Las pepitas：又是一家小红书推荐的餐厅，达咩❌</span></p><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5842">1:37:22</a> 西班牙的土特产是LV吧</span></p><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5896">1:38:16</a> 在香奈儿排了1h队，不买点什么感觉亏了</span></p><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5948">1:39:08</a> 购物当然要退税，手续费记得还价！！</span></p><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6095">1:41:35</a> 机场退税记得选现金，最好是欧元</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>长途飞行请带上：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6319">1:45:19</a> 加湿口罩、颈枕、压力袜、洗漱包</span></p><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6530">1:48:50</a> 在欧洲一定要防盗，但不用过度防盗</span></p><span></span><p><span>最后一句话总结开心旅行：</span><strong><span>出行之前J一点，玩得时候P一点</span></strong><span>，祝大家都拥有美好旅行～</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lv8PhiEU0sx-3PwqXoetPRfQRHCn.m4a" length="108248358" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:51:26</itunes:duration>
